{"availability":"available","full":"yeahhe365/AMC-WebUI","name":"AMC-WebUI","description":"面向 Gemini 的 Local-First AI 工作流 WebUI，集成多模态聊天、Canvas、文件处理、实时搜索、代码执行与高级推理。","category":"Design","language":"TypeScript","stars":931,"forks":190,"created":"2025-06-24T10:44:40Z","updated":"2026-10-19T01:17:07Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://all-model-chat.pages.dev/","topics":["ai","chatbot","gemini","gemini-api","google","image-generation","local-first","pwa","react","tailwindcss","typescript","vite"],"demo":"https://all-model-chat.pages.dev/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T20:15:15.679Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T20:15:15.679Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T20:15:15.679Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T19:03:14.473Z","stars":929,"forks":189},{"at":"2026-10-11T13:41:15.824Z","stars":930,"forks":189},{"at":"2026-10-13T04:16:20.334Z","stars":931,"forks":189},{"at":"2026-10-15T21:45:53.142Z","stars":930,"forks":189},{"at":"2026-10-18T05:01:50.460Z","stars":931,"forks":190},{"at":"2026-10-19T20:15:15.679Z","stars":931,"forks":190}],"technologies":["React"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["AMC WebUI 是一款基于 React 18 的 All-in-one Model Console WebUI，主打 Google Gemini 原生能力，并提供额外的 OpenAI 兼容标准聊天模式。项目坚持 Local-First 原则：聊天数据默认存储于浏览器 IndexedDB，在保障隐私的同时提供流畅体验；同时支持独立后端部署模式，用于服务端托管 Gemini 密钥与代理请求。","📢 Gemini Robotics-ER 模型迁移公告（2026-08-01） 项目已停止支持 gemini-robotics-er-1.6-preview（该模型已于 2026-08-31 停服），内置模型已迁移至 gemini-robotics-er-2-preview，全项目统一由常量 ROBOTICSMODEL（src/constants/modelConfiguration.ts）定义。 使用 Robotics 模型前：1) 请确保 GEMINIAPIKEY 已在 AI Studio 添加 API 限制，无限制 Key 会返回 403 Forbidden；2) 建议 thinkinglevel 默认 medium（延迟与性能平衡），仅高精度空间任务使用 high；3) 高精度场景可对同一输入多次查询取平均以降低方差。"],"features":["标准模式：本地通过 Vite 开发 / 构建，适合日常开发与静态部署","Docker 部署模式：web + api 双服务部署，普通 Gemini 请求走 /api/gemini/，第三方兼容接口走 /api/openai/，Live API 走 /api/live 的 WebSocket 全代理","静态前端 + 独立 API 模式：前端部署到 Pages/CDN，后端单独托管 Node API 服务"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yeahhe365/AMC-WebUI/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"635231460330bc2f5f25f0a69eecb490a1ccf5a4cfa1d25a5aa9f4ef9093db04","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T21:45:53.289Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T20:15:15.875Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"AMC WebUI 是一款基于 React 18 的 All-in-one Model Console WebUI，主打 Google Gemini 原生能力，并提供额外的 OpenAI 兼容标准聊天模式。项目坚持 Local-First 原则：聊天数据默认存储于浏览器 IndexedDB，在保障隐私的同时提供流畅体验；同时支持独立后端部署模式，用于服务端托管 Gemini 密钥与代理请求。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yeahhe365/AMC-WebUI/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"635231460330bc2f5f25f0a69eecb490a1ccf5a4cfa1d25a5aa9f4ef9093db04","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yeahhe365/AMC-WebUI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T20:15:15.876Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-19T01:17:07Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/yeahhe365/AMC-WebUI/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T20:15:15.878Z","hash":"635231460330bc2f5f25f0a69eecb490a1ccf5a4cfa1d25a5aa9f4ef9093db04","originalBytes":33490,"storedBytes":33490,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T20:15:15.679Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T19:04:16.469Z","latestRelease":{"name":"v1.23.0","tag":"v1.23.0","publishedAt":"2026-09-27T05:34:36Z","url":"https://github.com/yeahhe365/AMC-WebUI/releases/tag/v1.23.0"},"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T19:04:16.469Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/547bacd7ea064b92b1f84813.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-19T20:38:12.351Z","url":"https://all-model-chat.pages.dev/"}],"subjects":["Image, audio & video AI","Chatbots & assistants","Browser extensions & PWAs"],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Design","subjects":["Image, audio & video AI","Chatbots & assistants","Browser extensions & PWAs"],"evidence":[{"subject":"Image, audio & video AI","source":"metadata","match":"image generation"},{"subject":"Chatbots & assistants","source":"metadata","match":"chatbot"},{"subject":"